ind":"announcement","title":"STEAM NEXT FEST","summary":"Steam Next Fest is here and so is a free playable demo for Spell Code SlingerZ! From now until launch day on November 3rd, weave codes and sling spells completely free!Feedback for us? Join the community discord!Check out our socials! InstagramTiktokYouTube","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T14:25:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706695501","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4500000-1842212951303937","game_id":"steam-4500000","kind":"announcement","title":"8/28/2026 - The One That's Corrupted?","summary":"GeneralHello SlingerZ! We are approaching the end of our official structured development for Spell Code SlingerZ so this will be the last planned update before launch. The full version of Spell Code SlingerZ will come out near the end of October. With that out of the way, we are back again with a ḽ̶͉̠̬̈̏̌̑/̵̧͈̜̞̆͛͋̑a̴̝̓̂͐͛ṣ̵̢̯̲͕̮͕͆̀̈̆͝͝-̵̡̯̤̬͖͇̝͆̒̐͋͠f̵̘͕̩̹̟̑̔̈́̓̎̄͝d̶̢̦͇̲̟̙̊ and updates for you all! This update features: An end of round results screen, a more in depth tutorial level, and 2 new g","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-28T17:25:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951303937","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4500000-1841579228669614","game_id":"steam-4500000","kind":"update","title":"Aug 21 Update Delayed","summary":"8/21/2026 - Aug 21 Update DelayedHey SlingerZ. Unfortunately, there will be no update today but you can expect one next week. We feel that the features we’ve been working on are very exciting but not in a solid enough state to share with you all. We apologize for the delay and hope you all understand. With that being said, you can still expect a big update on August 28, 2026 that will include: An end of round results screen, more tutorialization for blocking and storing in the tutorial level, mo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T17:46:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228669614","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4500000-1840310314346499","game_id":"steam-4500000","kind":"announcement","title":"8/7/2026 - Base Spellcodes Complete","summary":"GeneralHello SlingerZ. We are back again with another round of new Spellcodes and updates for you all! We are proud to announce that with the addition of 8 new Spellcodes this update, we now have our completed total of 48 Spellcodes! This update also features: Turbo mode and gamemode selection menu, visual indicators for basic attack replacement Spellcodes, a new menu for inviting your friends, and training mode options. Here is an update to our roadmap with an overview of what you can see in th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-07T23:55:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314346499","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4500000-1839041357030425","game_id":"steam-4500000","kind":"update","title":"7/24/2026 - The Playstyle and Portal Patch","summary":"GeneralHello SlingerZ! We got your regularly scheduled helping of new Spellcodes and updates for you all to play with! This update is brought to you by the letter “P” and features: 8 new Spellcodes, a new menu to select your playstyle, 7 new arenas featuring portals, round and arena name display, and support for different screen resolutions. Keep reading for more details or hop right into the public playtest to try everything out for yourselves! Also, we’ll stop with the “P” alliteration now. He","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-24T18:40:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357030425","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4500000-1837955055363587","game_id":"steam-4500000","kind":"announcement","title":"Development Roadmap","summary":"Hello SlingerZ! Today we wanted to share with you our planned development roadmap 2 weeks in advance. The slides will be updated bi-weekly as new updates go out.The dates shown are when we expect to have each feature ready by, but they are not necessarily when each feature will release. If we need to change the timing for any reason, the roadmap will be updated to reflect as such. It can be accessed via the link below, and all slides can be found below as images as well. Thank you!Development Ro","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-13T14:24:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055363587","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4500000-1837955055357469","game_id":"steam-4500000","kind":"announcement","title":"7/10/26 - Matchmaking, Button Remapping and UI/UX","summary":"GeneralHello SlingerZ! We hope you have enjoyed last month’s Everything Update! This week, we have various UI/UX improvements for you, so let’s get right into it! Before that though, please take a moment to check out our new gameplay trailer which can be found here: ------------------------------Keyboard ControlsThe default keyboard controls have changed. While moving/code inputting has remained the same, the rest of the control defaults have changed.‘U’: Tap/Hold for Basic Attack/Code-Weave sta","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-10T16:57:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055357469","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4500000-1835871199316199","game_id":"steam-4500000","kind":"update","title":"The Everything Update","summary":"GeneralHello SlingerZ, it’s been a while! The last few months have been a bit busy for us. This project started out as our capstone project for our Masters Degrees, and as such we were entrenched in the tombs of documentation work for a while before taking a short break from development post-graduation. We’re finally ready to share what we’ve been working on over the past few months, so let’s get into it! As always, scroll down to the patch notes for the tl;dr version, although they are anything","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-23T16:59:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199316199","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4500000-1830163047260621","game_id":"steam-4500000","kind":"announcement","title":"Beta Test Now Open!","summary":"Hello Slingerz! We are happy to announce that the beta test for Spell Code SlingerZ is now open and free to play for all! It will be open for an indeterminate amount of time, but we will be sure to make an announcement before it closes!Here's what you can except:4 Developer Collectives catered to different play styles24 unique Spellcodes, 6 for each collective15 unique arenas to beat up your friends inA rogue-like progression for each game played, where after each round players will choose 1 new","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-17T15:46:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047260621","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4500000":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:32Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:31Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4500000":"2026-10-26T02:33:32Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4500000":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:31Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:31Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4935430":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:32Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:32Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4500000","app_id":4500000,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:37Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"cdb1cd20a2c94d5e29c163ecf276a0e1fa31d30e9dba6cc83836e7a00c92d4eb","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Weave codes and sling spells as a punk Y2K Spell Code Synthesizer in this 2-4 player, couch/online, 2D party brawler. Annihilate the opposition, acquire powerful new Spellcodes, and beat them down again in a first-to-3-wins style tournament.","publishers":[{"name":"Practical Media"},{"name":"BitForwardGames"}],"developers":[{"name":"BitForwardGames"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1793718000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Next Fest and Release trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1792417246","trailer_category":3,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4500000/148251856/c49d290bc44c730a529a07d44ec336c8109199c5/1792416394/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"